text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CvBWhu5RdyD","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1951","post_id":"1951","platform":"instagram","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cu2DjxmvLeI/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1951/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1732","post_id":"1732","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0fPf17FPKy8x93DPNrLGM99RrXguYqbPDhuWBnvmNeAjuHtAeS6rGaGN41jgfhgGrl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1732/","text":"We're partnering with Microsoft to introduce Llama 2, the next generation of our open source large language model. Llama 2 will be available for free for research and commercial use.\n\nMeta has a long...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0fPf17FPKy8x93DPNrLGM99RrXguYqbPDhuWBnvmNeAjuHtAeS6rGaGN41jgfhgGrl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1729","post_id":"1729","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/Cu2Ep0XP9RT","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1729/","text":"Open sourcing Llama 2 today. What do you want to see researchers and businesses build with our next-gen large language model?","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/Cu2Ep0XP9RT","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1730","post_id":"1730","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/Cu0BgHESnwF","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1730/","text":"I'm very optimistic about how the Threads community is coming together. Early growth was off the charts, but more importantly 10s of millions of people now come back daily. That's way ahead of what we expected. The focus for the rest of the year is improving the basics and retention. It'll take time to stabilize, but once we nail that then we'll focus on growing the community. We've run this playbook many times (FB, IG, Stories, Reels, etc) and I'm confident Threads is on a good path too.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/Cu0BgHESnwF","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1731","post_id":"1731","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/Cuw_QlKxvbq","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1731/","text":"Calm morning on the lake before another big week ahead.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/Cuw_QlKxvbq","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1733","post_id":"1733","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02Gjy1t8nBBPumJiFVxgyVCneaFLSPMAs3GWLvbAaoebddzobkAGTwKPnLNNoQCQTUl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1733/","text":"Get ready: Roblox is coming to Meta Quest with an open beta on App Lab in the coming weeks. Excited for Roblox developers to build virtual reality experiences and gather feedback from our awesome...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02Gjy1t8nBBPumJiFVxgyVCneaFLSPMAs3GWLvbAaoebddzobkAGTwKPnLNNoQCQTUl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1952","post_id":"1952","platform":"instagram","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CukZy18hHAZ/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1952/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1953","post_id":"1953","platform":"instagram","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cuh6BYqSTd5/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1953/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1719","post_id":"1719","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuhOXGmr74R/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1719/","text":"Threads reached 100 million sign ups over the weekend. That's mostly organic demand and we haven't even turned on many promotions yet. Can't believe it's only been 5 days!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuhOXGmr74R/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1720","post_id":"1720","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuduMHoLbTg/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1720/","text":"Beautiful work out there @alexvolkanovski","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuduMHoLbTg/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1721","post_id":"1721","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuZsgfWLyiI/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-07","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1721/","text":"70 million sign ups on Threads as of this morning. Way beyond our expectations.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuZsgfWLyiI/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1723","post_id":"1723","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/CuXCjGVrd6R/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-06","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1723/","text":"Wow, 30 million sign ups as of this morning. Feels like the beginning of something special, but we've got a lot of work ahead to build out the app.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_