/1717/","text":"Threads is here. Let's do this. 🔥","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid07QwAr3mRiMudqbFFQtkYxEUyUMGpuB6nTGyhuaNkkNPs98pKt7xFmgT53251WGe9l","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1716","post_id":"1716","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/reel/1473910143421814","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-05","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1716/","text":"Meet Threads, an open and friendly public space for conversation. Our vision is to take the best parts of Instagram and create a new experience for text, ideas, and discussing what's on your mind. I...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/reel/1473910143421814","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1718","post_id":"1718","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02Vg8AqjTaZHjPdYizqikoxx1zoPHhqBWD8iy4ASkJxA3fFjnKLPVscgMLnVwk9qRml","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-07-04","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1718/","text":"Happy July 4th! 🇺🇸 Lots to be grateful for this year. As the big girls get older, I love talking to them about why America is so great. Looking forward to discussing with little Aurelia soon too.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02Vg8AqjTaZHjPdYizqikoxx1zoPHhqBWD8iy4ASkJxA3fFjnKLPVscgMLnVwk9qRml","text_truncated":false}]